      "text": "The function \\( g \\) has derivatives of all orders, and its values at \\( x = -2 \\) are \\( g(-2) = 1 \\), \\( g'(-2) = 3 \\), \\( g''(-2) = -2 \\), \\( g'''(-2) = 12 \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( g \\) about \\( x = -2 \\)."
